{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{5.body.properties.email}}"],
  "subject": "Welcome to CWI AI \u2014 you're all set",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#0b2545;padding:28px 32px;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;\">CWI AI</h1></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:32px;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2545;\">Welcome aboard, {{5.body.properties.firstname}}!</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">We're thrilled to have {{ifempty(5.body.properties.company, 'your team')}} as a CWI AI client. Everything is set up on our end and we're ready to get your automation working for you.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:16px;color:#0b2545;\">Your next steps</h3><ol style=\"margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;\"><li>Book your kickoff call so we can align on goals and timeline.</li><li>We'll gather access and details during that call \u2014 no prep required.</li><li>Your build begins immediately after kickoff.</li></ol><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#1b9aaa;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"{{env.CALENDLY_LINK}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">Schedule Your Kickoff Call</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">Questions before then? Just reply to this email or reach us during business hours (9 AM\u20136 PM ET, Monday\u2013Friday).</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">Talk soon,<br/><strong>Brian</strong><br/>CWI AI<br/>brian@cwiai.net<br/>(734) 812-9971</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#f0f2f5;padding:16px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;\">CWI AI \u2014 Business hours: 9 AM\u20136 PM ET, Monday\u2013Friday.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
}

{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["brian@cwiai.net"],
  "subject": "New client onboarded: {{trim(5.body.properties.firstname + ' ' + 5.body.properties.lastname)}}, {{2.body.properties.dealname}}, ${{2.body.properties.amount}}/mo",
  "html": "<h2>New Client Onboarded \ud83c\udf89</h2><p>A deal just closed and the onboarding automation completed.</p><hr><h3>Client</h3><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> {{trim(5.body.properties.firstname + ' ' + 5.body.properties.lastname)}}</li><li><strong>Company:</strong> {{ifempty(5.body.properties.company, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> {{5.body.properties.email}}</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> {{ifempty(5.body.properties.phone, 'N/A')}}</li></ul><h3>Deal</h3><ul><li><strong>Deal Name (Tier):</strong> {{2.body.properties.dealname}}</li><li><strong>Monthly Amount:</strong> ${{2.body.properties.amount}}/mo</li><li><strong>HubSpot Deal ID:</strong> {{1.body.dealId}}</li><li><strong>HubSpot Company ID:</strong> {{6.body.results[0].id}}</li><li><strong>Pipeline:</strong> {{2.body.properties.pipeline}}</li></ul><h3>Automation</h3><ul><li>Company marked Active Client: yes</li><li>Added to ActiveClients sheet: yes</li><li>Welcome email sent to client: yes</li><li><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{formatDate(now, 'YYYY-MM-DD', 'America/New_York')}} ET</li></ul><hr><p><em>Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation \u2014 Scenario H: Client Onboarding.</em></p>"
}

{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["brian@cwiai.net"],
  "subject": "[ERROR] Make.com \u2014 Scenario H Client Onboarding Failed",
  "html": "<h2>Client Onboarding Error \u2014 Scenario H</h2><p>The onboarding automation failed. Please review and complete onboarding manually in HubSpot, Google Sheets, and email.</p><hr><h3>Context</h3><ul><li><strong>HubSpot Deal ID:</strong> {{1.body.dealId}}</li><li><strong>Deal Name:</strong> {{2.body.properties.dealname}}</li><li><strong>Amount:</strong> ${{2.body.properties.amount}}/mo</li><li><strong>Contact Email:</strong> {{5.body.properties.email}}</li><li><strong>Contact Name:</strong> {{5.body.properties.firstname}} {{5.body.properties.lastname}}</li><li><strong>Company ID:</strong> {{6.body.results[0].id}}</li></ul><hr><h3>Error Details</h3><ul><li><strong>Error Message:</strong> {{error.message}}</li><li><strong>Failed Module:</strong> {{error.module}}</li><li><strong>Scenario Run ID:</strong> {{scenario.runId}}</li><li><strong>Timestamp:</strong> {{formatDate(now, 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss', 'America/New_York')}} ET</li></ul><hr><p><em>Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation \u2014 Scenario H: Client Onboarding.</em></p>"
}
